    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a Garden Designer and choose a gardener to tackle jobs across the sprawling City Park and the residential area of Sky Valley. Manage, design and plant gardens and construct structures as you bring your creative visions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gardening Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and save money to purchase your own plot of land, where you can build and craft a captivating garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Buildings and Gardens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the entire scenic panorama, from the residential suburb to the expansive city park, completing tasks that lead you across the diverse landscape. Discover parks, cafe's, monuments, and sports grounds as you commute on foot or by vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Beautiful Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a character (Male or Female) and explore the City Park, assisting the park management with tasks tailored to that character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undertake gardening jobs including short grass mowing, long grass cutting, hedge trimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a vehicle to drive between jobs in the City Park and residential area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design gardens from a selection of 40 plants and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build small structures like a garden shed or larger buildings such as a house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your gardens with ornaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up and buy a plot of land to create your own gardening vision</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a Garden Designer and choose a gardener to tackle jobs across the sprawling City Park and the residential area of Sky Valley. Manage, design and plant gardens and construct structures as you bring your creative visions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gardening Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/edcd955cbfd7b8f0602311988c27f98c.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and save money to purchase your own plot of land, where you can build and craft a captivating garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Buildings and Gardens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/f2818eba323462157a3dd34d7d4c9047.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the entire scenic panorama, from the residential suburb to the expansive city park, completing tasks that lead you across the diverse landscape. Discover parks, cafe's, monuments, and sports grounds as you commute on foot or by vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Beautiful Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.poster.avif?t=1746171029\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.webm?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733450/extras/26282c8fb8e8605b2cec38582418e8c3.mp4?t=1746171029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a character (Male or Female) and explore the City Park, assisting the park management with tasks tailored to that character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undertake gardening jobs including short grass mowing, long grass cutting, hedge trimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a vehicle to drive between jobs in the City Park and residential area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design gardens from a selection of 40 plants and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build small structures like a garden shed or larger buildings such as a house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your gardens with ornaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up and buy a plot of land to create your own gardening vision</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Garden Designer offers a rich experience filled with gardening and construction tasks. Select your gardener and let your creativity shine as you design and manage gardens, and build structures in picturesque parks and residences. Create unique buildings and gardens for an unforgettable adventure!",
